<title>AUSTRALIA: North Flinders gold production a record.</title>
<headline>North Flinders gold production a record.</headline>
<dateline>ADELAIDE 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gold miner North Flinders Mines Ltd said on Wednesday its gold production for the 12 months to June 30, 1997 was a record 236,560 ounces, 4.8 percent higher than the previous year.</p>
<p>However, fourth quarter production was two percent lower at 61,418 ounces due to downtime for mill work. As a consequence, total cash cost rose to A$263 per ounce from A$232 per ounce, the company said.</p>
<p>Total production cost for the quarter was A$307 per ounce while the annual total production cost was A$313 per ounce.</p>
</text>
